cing.test.ts`. They cover exact rounding at the half boundaries (29, 30 and 31 out of 60), 1-, 30- and 45-minute prices, deposits on fractional subtotals, and every overlap and back-to-back case. They also cover hold expiry at exactly `expiresAt`, a custom maximum hold from the environment, and failed calls leaving stored bookings unchanged.","ttft_ms":2712,"type":"result","duration_ms":86524,"uuid":"7286d081-6bd2-48d8-b57f-429872277687","ttft_stream_ms":1907,"time_to_request_ms":483,"first_content_frame_ms":1908,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-12-23T22:59:00.336Z"}

